ng horizontal scroll"],[590,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[634,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1591,"**Tab**"],[278,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[1032,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1206,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1531,"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the copy needs."],[1529,"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."],[1530,"**The title is `<Heading slot=\"title\">`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the\nvisual size: `size` handles the visuals, so `level={1}` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."],[1100,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1587,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1586,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[1725,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"],[1714,"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"],[649,"**Trade-offs:**"],[591,"**Transform**: `rotate`, `flip` for icon transformations"],[411,"**Trigger and calendar**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a calendar icon and the formatted value from the field. `DatePickerCalendar` (and `DateRangePickerCalendar`) is the calendar in the popover it opens: it takes `Calendar` props plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `Calendar` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[1238,"**Trigger and options**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders the selected value and a chevron from the field. `SelectOptions` is the list in the popover the Select opens: it takes `ListBox` props (including `items` with a render function for a dynamic collection) plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `ListBox` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[800,"**Type to select**: jump to a matching item (string labels are used as `textValue`)"],[1901,"**Typed Refs:** Refs are correctly typed based on the `as` value - `useRef<HTMLButtonElement>` works with `as=\"button\"`."],[585,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[1693,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[1965,"**Use `Grid` when**: You need explicit two-dimensional layouts with rows and columns, named grid areas, or responsive auto-fill patterns."],[652,"**Use default mode** for SSR applications or when icons appear infrequently"],[653,"**Use sprite mode** when the same icons appear many times (navigation, lists, tables)"],[663,"**Use sprite mode**: For repeated icons, consider sprite mode which consolidates multiple icons into a single SVG sprite sheet, reducing DOM size and improving performance when the same icon appears multiple times"],[887,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1242,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1489,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[885,"**Value scale**: `minValue`, `maxValue`, `step`, and `formatOptions` configure the numeric behavior"],[1743,"**Verify event targets**: Tooltips use mouse event coordinates and bar group positions"],[1685,"**Vertical and horizontal orientations**: Choose the best layout for your data and use case"],[1719,"**Vertical charts**: Horizontal scrolling when many data points exceed container width"],[1694,"**VisX integration**: Leverages VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"],[639,"**What happens with sprite mode:**"],[1333,"`--color-input-background-default`"],[1330,"`--