ox` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[538,"`Heading` renders a semantic `h1`-`h6` element via the `level` prop.\nInside a `Modal`/`Dialog`, add `slot=\"title\"` and it labels the dialog automatically."],[221,"`href` turns the Card into a native link. Modifier-click, middle-click, and \"Open in new tab\" work\non the surface. Body text is not selectable. The link covers the whole Card, so do not put\nCornerActions, buttons, inputs, selection, or other controls in an `href` Card. Clicking body text\non an `onPress` or selection Card activates it; dragging that text selects it."],[696,"`InlineDrawerPanel` is the collapsible content for the accordion pattern — a thin wrapper over RAC `DisclosurePanel` that hides when collapsed. The trigger is any component you slot in with `slot=\"trigger\"` — there's no dedicated trigger component."],[725,"`Input` is the single-line control inside a field, not a field on its own. Prefer `TextField` or `NumberField` as the parent; see those components for fuller examples."],[222,"`isDisabled` disables only the primary. `isSelectionDisabled` disables only selection. Radio\nread-only and validation state belong on `RadioGroup`."],[1840,"`legendPosition` puts the legend above or below the plot, or hides it with `null`. Multi-series charts get a bottom legend by default."],[1895,"`lg` - Large spacing"],[754,"`ListBox` requires either `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`. For a labeled, popover-style picker, prefer `Select`."],[1894,"`md` - Medium spacing"],[789,"`MenuTrigger` exposes its open state via `isOpen`/`onOpenChange`,\nwhich can be used to drive the rotation of a chevron icon."],[151,"`minValue` / `maxValue` bounds and `isDateUnavailable` per-day disabling"],[415,"`minValue` / `maxValue` bounds and `isDateUnavailable` per-day disabling"],[855,"`Modal` accepts `isOpen` and `onOpenChange` directly, so it can be controlled without a\n`ModalTrigger`. Useful when the modal is opened 