reviated dates on one axis, thousands separators on the other. The functions receive the raw accessor value, so they also cover currency, units, or percentages."],[1841,"`xTickFormat` and `yTickFormat` shape the axis labels - dates, currency, units, percentages - and the tooltip follows the same formatting."],[1838,"`xTickMarks` and `yTickMarks` draw the short lines at each tick value, which helps tie a label to its exact position on the axis."],[1836,"`xTitle` and `yTitle` label what each axis actually measures, e.g. \"Month\" and \"Temperature (°F)\"."],[1846,"`xZero` and `yZero` stretch the domain to include zero. Worth doing when the absolute size of the values matters, not just their movement."],[1731,"✅ Custom domains"],[1732,"✅ Design system alignment"],[1352,"✅ For binary on/off preferences (e.g. Wi-Fi, notifications, dark mode)"],[1606,"✅ For compact action grouping — related actions in space-constrained layouts (e.g. Undo / Redo, Zoom In / Out / Reset)"],[1605,"✅ For grouped contextual actions — two or more closely related actions that belong together (e.g. Bold / Italic / Underline, Align Left / Center / Right)"],[1607,"✅ For multi-select scenarios — when users need to select multiple options simultaneously"],[286,"✅ For selecting multiple independent options"],[1351,"✅ For settings that take effect immediately, without a form submission"],[288,"✅ For toggling settings or features on/off"],[1730,"✅ Interactive tooltips"],[1729,"✅ Responsive behavior with sticky axes"],[1727,"✅ Single and multi-series support"],[1728,"✅ Vertical and horizontal orientations"],[289,"✅ When all available options should be visible"],[1043,"✅ When all options should be visible at once"],[1044,"✅ When the decision is important and deserves space"],[1042,"✅ When there are 2-7 mutually exclusive options"],[287,"✅ When users can select zero, one, or many items"],[1046,"❌ For binary yes/no choices (use Checkbox or Toggle instead)"],[1354,"❌ For choosing one of several mutually exclu